Create a basic ATM program where a user can perform banking operations.

Requirements:

Start with an initial balance of ₹10,000.
Ask the user for a 4-digit PIN.
Allow the user to perform operations:
Check Balance
Deposit Money
Withdraw Money
Exit
Don't allow withdrawal if:
Amount is greater than balance.
Amount is zero or negative.
After every transaction, display the updated balance.
The user should be able to perform multiple operations until they choose Exit.
Give an appropriate message for an incorrect PIN.

Concepts covered:
while loop, if-else, match-case, input, arithmetic operators, boolean logic.